    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "The shared list-detail view now supports 1-6 consecutive table barrels. The compact minus/count/plus control sits above the table area, later-barrel rows open the same detail pane, and the bottom pager disappears when one barrel group contains all results. Lexeditor saves the count locally for each game and view, so changing FF8 Magic does not change Items or another plugin. Restart Lexeditor once, then please check the control placement and table readability in your normal window size.",
